  "details": "For example the Quest 2 and 3 have the same Avatars hand in a noticably different yaw\n\nAnd the same headset going from PC VR to standalone has a noticably different position and rotation (every setup has a different rotation and position offset)\n\nMeanwhile other VR games have them in the same general position and rotation\n\nThis makes objects in the hand feel odd or just wrong when made by a user of a different headset",
